response:
The report describes cyber threat activity tracked as UAC-0145, in which an employee of a Ukrainian municipal enterprise downloaded a pirated ISO image of Microsoft Office 2019 from the Torrent-Toloka tracker. The ISO image contained an executable dropper (AUTORUN.exe) that deployed DarkCrystal RAT (DCRat). The attackers subsequently deployed the DWAgent remote administration tool via a custom launcher identified as PinkyAgent, utilizing Python.

